{"items":[{"ownerHandle":"benzema216","slug":"rss-ai-reader","displayName":"Rss Ai Reader","summary":"📰 RSS AI 阅读器 — 自动抓取订阅、LLM生成摘要、多渠道推送！\n支持 Claude/OpenAI 生成中文摘要，推送到飞书/Telegram/Email。\n触发条件: 用户要求订阅RSS、监控博客、抓取新闻、生成摘要、设置定时抓取、\n\"帮我订阅\"、\"监控这个网站\"、\"每天推送新闻\"、RSS/Atom feed 相关。","description":null,"topics":["RSS","Email","Telegram","定时","新闻"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8711,"installs":287,"stars":14,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770023411548,"updatedAt":1778987851184,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770023411548,"changelog":"- 首次发布 RSS AI 阅读器：自动抓取 RSS/Atom 订阅，利用 Claude/OpenAI 生成中文摘要，并多渠道推送（飞书、Telegram、Email）。\n- 配置简单，支持定时任务和 SQLite 去重，避免重复推送。\n- 命令行支持单次执行、定时任务和查看统计信息。\n- 详细文档与配置示例，便于快速上手。","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jernejcicorbin-hub","slug":"lead-enrichment-skill","displayName":"Lead Enrichment Skill","summary":"Enrich a company or person lead from public-web signals before outreach. Produces an ICP-fit verdict, key facts, red flags, and optional structured output.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8707,"installs":308,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1778619833672,"updatedAt":1778620006849,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1778619833672,"changelog":"Initial release of lead-enrichment skill.\n\n- Enriches company or person leads using public web signals via Prismfy.\n- Produces a fit verdict (fit, likely_fit, weak_fit, not_fit, ambiguous) with key facts, red flags, and optional structured JSON output.\n- Supports enrichment and qualification before outreach, surfacing disqualifiers and handling ambiguity.\n- Integrates with openclaw, requires PRISMFY_API_KEY, curl, and jq.\n- Includes clear setup instructions, command examples, output formats, and failure handling guidance.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"PRISMFY_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"gonghaiquan","slug":"douyin-publish","displayName":"Douyin Video Publisher","summary":"自动登录抖音账号，上传并发布视频到抖音创作者平台，支持视频标签管理和登录状态检查。","description":null,"topics":["创作","抖音"],"tags":{"douyin":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","mcp":"1.0.0","short-video":"1.0.0","tiktok":"1.0.0","video-upload":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8700,"installs":271,"stars":25,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770963413746,"updatedAt":1779076873744,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770963413746,"changelog":"Initial release: Auto login, upload and publish videos to Douyin Creator Platform","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"wanng-ide","slug":"api-tester","displayName":"Api Tester","summary":"Perform structured HTTP/HTTPS requests (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) with custom headers and JSON body support. Use for API testing, health checks, or interacting...","description":null,"topics":["Json"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8692,"installs":268,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771169371371,"updatedAt":1778491545704,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771169371371,"changelog":"- Initial release of api-tester, a lightweight, dependency-free HTTP client for OpenClaw.\n- Supports structured HTTP/HTTPS requests (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) with custom headers and JSON body.\n- Automatically stringifies JSON bodies and parses JSON responses.\n- Includes timeout support (default 10s, configurable).\n- Provides structured response with status, headers, parsed data, raw body, and error messaging.\n- No external dependencies; uses Node.js built-in http/https modules.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"sebastian-buitrag0","slug":"telegram-bot","displayName":"Telegram Bot Builder","summary":"Build and manage Telegram bots via the Telegram Bot API. Create bots, send messages, handle webhooks, manage groups and channels.","description":null,"topics":["Telegram"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8669,"installs":272,"stars":9,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769714362774,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769714362774,"changelog":"Initial release of the Telegram Bot Builder skill.\n\n- Build and manage Telegram bots via the Telegram Bot API.\n- Provides setup instructions and environment variable configuration.\n- Includes commands for sending messages, media, and managing chats/groups.\n- Supports webhooks and polling for bot updates.\n- Features message editing, deletion, forwarding, and keyboard markup examples.\n- Useful code snippets and bash script for launching a simple echo bot.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"jernejcicorbin-hub","slug":"contact-discovery","displayName":"Lead Contact Finder","summary":"Find public contact details for a person or company using Prismfy-powered web search. Use when a user wants a public email, contact path, press/support page,...","description":null,"topics":["Web Search","Email"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8666,"installs":307,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1778619902823,"updatedAt":1778620906774,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1778619902823,"changelog":"Initial release of contact-discovery skill.\n\n- Finds public contact details or clue paths for people or companies via Prismfy-powered web search.\n- Surfaces public emails, official contact pages, or company email-format clues with sources—never guesses or invents private data.\n- Flexible inputs: supports company, domain, person, and role parameters; requires at least one anchor.\n- Provides clear verdicts (e.g., public_email_found, contact_path_found) and highlights the most reliable public evidence.\n- Outputs concise chat summaries and optional JSON reports; includes robust setup, execution, and safety guidance.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"PRISMFY_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"one-drive","displayName":"Microsoft OneDrive","summary":"OneDrive API integration with managed OAuth via Microsoft Graph. Manage files, folders, and sharing. Use this skill when users want to upload, download, organize, or share files in OneDrive. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Requires network access and valid Maton API key. Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn an OneDrive connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs an OneDrive action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with OneDrive examples; they add no OneDrive capability - OneDrive is not an event source, a trigger cannot read OneDrive data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8661,"installs":266,"stars":10,"versions":15},"createdAt":1770462975318,"updatedAt":1790939486251,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790939348398,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"thomeksolutions","slug":"web-deploy-github","displayName":"Web Deploy GitHub Pages","summary":"Create and deploy single-page static websites to GitHub Pages with autonomous workflow. Use when building portfolio sites, CV pages, landing pages, or any static web project that needs GitHub Pages deployment. Handles complete workflow from project initialization to live deployment with GitHub Actions automation.","description":null,"topics":["Deploy","GitHub","Deployment"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8653,"installs":295,"stars":9,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769721637588,"updatedAt":1778987398337,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769721637588,"changelog":"v1.0.0 - Initial Release\n\nFeatures:\n- Complete workflow for creating and deploying static websites to GitHub Pages\n- Automated deployment scripts (init_project.sh, deploy_github_pages.sh)\n- Three ready-to-use templates: base HTML, portfolio/CV, and landing page\n- Comprehensive design patterns and best practices documentation\n- Mobile-first responsive design patterns\n- GitHub Actions integration for automatic deployment\n- Modern CSS and JavaScript patterns\n- Full documentation of autonomous generation workflow","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"fontstep","slug":"send-email","displayName":"send-email","summary":"Send emails via SMTP. Configure in ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json under skills.entries.send-email.env.","description":null,"topics":["Send Email","Json"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":8653,"installs":296,"stars":5,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770086100965,"updatedAt":1778485997364,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1770087403235,"changelog":"- Initial release of the send-email skill.\n- Allows sending emails via SMTP with environment-based credential injection.\n- Supports attachments and multiple mail providers (163, Gmail, QQ).\n- Emphasizes security: never read config files directly; all sensitive data is injected at runtime.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"2mawi2","slug":"spotify","displayName":"Spotify","summary":"Control Spotify playback on macOS. Play/pause, skip tracks, control volume, play artists/albums/playlists. Use when a user asks to play music, control Spotify, change songs, or adjust Spotify volume.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8644,"installs":276,"stars":9,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769259365613,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769259365613,"changelog":"Initial release: Control Spotify on macOS via CLI and AppleScript","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ovyeddeno","slug":"gstack","displayName":"Gstack","summary":"Fast headless browser for QA testing and site dogfooding. Navigate any URL, interact with elements, verify page state, diff before/after actions, take annota...","description":null,"topics":["Deployment","Browser"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8628,"installs":195,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773785120682,"updatedAt":1778491985988,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773785120682,"changelog":"gstack v1.1.0 introduces enhanced instructions and contributor workflows.\n\n- Expanded documentation with detailed QA, dogfooding, and browser automation examples.\n- Clear setup and upgrade flows for smoother initial setup and version upgrades.\n- Standardized AskUserQuestion formatting for consistent user clarification.\n- New Contributor Mode: prompts field reports for actionable tool improvements, guiding power users through easy feedback filing.\n- Additional guidance for edge cases (build setup, binary requirements, session handling) to reduce setup friction.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"cluka-399","slug":"gemini-image-simple","displayName":"Gemini Image Simple","summary":"Generate and edit images with Gemini API using pure Python stdlib. Zero dependencies - works on locked-down environments where pip/uv aren't available.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8581,"installs":304,"stars":3,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769868732799,"updatedAt":1778485878349,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1769977821317,"changelog":"- Switched image generation model to \"Nano Banana Pro\" (`nano-banana-pro-preview`), delivering highest quality image generation (Gemini 3 Pro Image).\n- Updated documentation to reflect the new model and its aliases, including information about alternative models.\n- Enhanced \"How It Works\" and \"Model\" sections in SKILL.md for clarity and transparency.\n- All functionality remains dependency-free and continues to work on any Python 3.10+ installation.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"GEMINI_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"lucasayala","slug":"automation-workflows-0-1-0","displayName":"Automation Workflows 0.1.0","summary":"Design and implement automation workflows to save time and scale operations as a solopreneur. Use when identifying repetitive tasks to automate, building workflows across tools, setting up triggers and actions, or optimizing existing automations. Covers automation opportunity identification, workflow design, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), testing, and maintenance. Trigger on \"automate\", \"automation\", \"workflow automation\", \"save time\", \"reduce manual work\", \"automate my business\", \"no-code automation\".","description":null,"topics":["N8n","Zapier","Automation Workflow","Workflow Automation"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8572,"installs":301,"stars":12,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770484414301,"updatedAt":1778486075083,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770484414301,"changelog":"Initial release of automation-workflows.\n\n- Provides a step-by-step playbook for solopreneurs to identify, design, and implement no-code automation workflows.\n- Covers how to audit tasks for automation opportunities and prioritize high-impact, repetitive processes.\n- Compares leading no-code automation tools (Zapier, Make, n8n) and offers selection guidance.\n- Includes workflow design templates, practical examples, and best practices for simple and complex automations.\n- Details testing, error handling, monitoring, and documentation to ensure automations remain reliable and effective.\n- Offers advanced automation ideas tailored for common solopreneur needs (client onboarding, content distribution, and more).","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"zjianru","slug":"web-search-pro","displayName":"Web Search Pro","summary":"Agent-first web search and retrieval for live web search, news search, docs lookup, code lookup, company research, site crawl, site map, and structured evide...","description":null,"topics":["Web Search","Crawl","Docs","News"],"tags":{"latest":"2.1.4"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8570,"installs":261,"stars":10,"versions":10},"createdAt":1770626768740,"updatedAt":1778486092879,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.1.4","createdAt":1773473923731,"changelog":"Split docs by audience and language: English-only README, standalone README_zh, clearer agent-facing SKILL contract, and audited doc audience framing.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"config.json","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"jdrhyne","slug":"google-ads","displayName":"google-ads","summary":"Query, audit, and optimize Google Ads campaigns. Use an attached browser or the Google Ads API for campaign, keyword, budget, conversion-tracking, and wasted-spend analysis, or when the user explicitly requests a reviewed account change. Defaults to read-only reporting; account mutations require a bounded preview and action-time approval.","description":null,"topics":["google-ads","advertising","campaign-analysis","paid-search"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8567,"installs":257,"stars":14,"versions":6},"createdAt":1768839887563,"updatedAt":1788094775873,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.0","createdAt":1788094724564,"changelog":"Harden read-only analysis, browser and API routing, goal-aware recommendations, credential handling, and bounded approval-gated mutations.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"GOOGLE_ADS_DEVELOPER_TOKEN","required":false},{"key":"GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_ID","required":false},{"key":"GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET","required":false},{"key":"GOOGLE_ADS_REFRESH_TOKEN","required":false},{"key":"GOOGLE_ADS_LOGIN_CUSTOMER_ID","required":false},{"key":"GOOGLE_ADS_CONFIGURATION_FILE_PATH","required":false}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"sfkislev","slug":"the-news","displayName":"The News","summary":"gives agents real-time and archival access to front-page headlines across 20 countries for breaking news, current events, and comparative media analysis.","description":null,"topics":["news","headlines","archive","global-news"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.17"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8546,"installs":244,"stars":1,"versions":18},"createdAt":1777748691742,"updatedAt":1782906479751,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.17","createdAt":1782906479751,"changelog":"- No user-facing changes in this version.\n- Documentation and functionality remain the same; no file changes detected.\n- minor wording update in the news.txt file","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ye4wzp","slug":"feishu-toolkit","displayName":"Feishu Toolkit","summary":"Complete Feishu (Lark) integration toolkit for AI agents. Read/write documents, fetch chat history, send files & screenshots, manage permissions, and create...","description":null,"topics":["Feishu","Chat","Lark","Document","Permission"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8541,"installs":257,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773248930110,"updatedAt":1778998007829,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773248930110,"changelog":"Initial release: comprehensive Feishu/Lark integration - docs, chat, files, screenshots, permissions, reminders","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"qqk000","slug":"eastmoney-fin-search","displayName":"eastmoney skills","summary":"本skill基于东方财富妙想搜索能力，基于金融场景进行信源智能筛选，用于获取涉及时效性信息或特定事件信息的任务，包括新闻、公告、研报、政策、交易规则、具体事件、各种影响分析、以及需要检索外部数据的非常识信息等。避免AI在搜索金融场景信息时，参考到非权威、及过时的信息。","description":null,"topics":["交易","新闻","金融"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8536,"installs":232,"stars":21,"versions":6},"createdAt":1773375874618,"updatedAt":1778491872769,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1773818355791,"changelog":"- Skill name changed from \"mx_search\" to \"eastmoney_fin_search\"\n- Added `required_env_vars` and `credentials` sections to the skill manifest for clearer API key requirements\n- Updated description and metadata formatting at the top for better structure and clarity\n- No code or functionality changes detected","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"katrina-jpg","slug":"crypto-trading-bot","displayName":"Crypto Trading Bot","summary":"加密貨幣交易機器人開發 - 幫你整自動交易Bot，支持Pine Script、Python、CCXT API對接。適用於：(1)整TradingView信號Bot (2)CEX/DEX API自動化 (3)套利機器人 (4)止盈止損策略","description":null,"topics":["Crypto Trading","Developer","交易"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":8535,"installs":273,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771543936527,"updatedAt":1778491585715,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771543936527,"changelog":"Crypto Trading Bot Developer skill released.\n\n- 支持開發自動加密貨幣交易機器人，涵蓋TradingView信號觸發、CEX/DEX API自動化、套利和止盈止損策略。\n- 適用於多種交易所（Binance, Bybit, OKX等）及現貨/合約、網格和自定義策略。\n- 提供明確開發流程和報價範圍。\n- 主要採用Python、Pine Script、Node.js等技術。","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"google-ads-api","displayName":"Google Ads","summary":"Google Ads API integration with managed OAuth. Query campaigns, ad groups, keywords, and performance metrics with GAQL. Use this skill when users want to interact with Google Ads data. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Google Ads connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Google Ads action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Google Ads examples; they add no Google Ads capability - Google Ads is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Google Ads data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.8"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8522,"installs":263,"stars":21,"versions":19},"createdAt":1770022035827,"updatedAt":1790937513539,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.8","createdAt":1790937386311,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"jarvis-drakon","slug":"shieldcortex","displayName":"ShieldCortex","summary":"Memory and defence for AI agents: semantic recall, knowledge graph and decay, plus a memory firewall that scans and enforces against prompt injection, credential leaks and poisoning.","description":null,"topics":["Prompt Injection","Learning"],"tags":{"latest":"5.10.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8510,"installs":100,"stars":2,"versions":189},"createdAt":1770998187206,"updatedAt":1792479536986,"latestVersion":{"version":"5.10.6","createdAt":1792479087248,"changelog":"Sync from npm publish v5.10.6","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"lura2","slug":"canvas","displayName":"Canvas","summary":"Display and control HTML content on connected Mac, iOS, or Android nodes via a web-based canvas with live reload and remote actions.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8487,"installs":770,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771261950369,"updatedAt":1778991000535,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771261950369,"changelog":"Initial release of the Canvas skill for OpenClaw:\n\n- Adds ability to display HTML content on Mac, iOS, and Android node canvases\n- Supports presenting, navigating, hiding, JavaScript eval, and screenshot actions for the canvas\n- Integrates Tailscale and LAN binding options for easy remote access\n- Includes live reload for instant updates during development\n- Provides detailed setup, configuration, and troubleshooting instructions\n- Serves files from a configurable root directory via a dedicated HTTP server","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jhumanj","slug":"apollo","displayName":"Apollo","summary":"Interact with Apollo.io REST API (people/org enrichment, search, lists).","description":null,"topics":["Rest Api"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8487,"installs":290,"stars":4,"versions":1},"createdAt":1768824148326,"updatedAt":1778485733200,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768824148326,"changelog":"Initial release","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["darwin","linux"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"chandrasekar-r","slug":"security-monitor","displayName":"Security Monitor","summary":"Real-time security monitoring for Clawdbot. Detects intrusions, unusual API calls, credential usage patterns, and alerts on breaches.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"intrusion-detection":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","monitoring":"1.0.0","realtime":"1.0.0","security":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8483,"installs":298,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769467400470,"updatedAt":1778987182701,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769467400470,"changelog":"Initial release: brute force detection, port anomaly monitoring, process monitoring, file change detection, Docker health checks","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"stuhorsman","slug":"yahoo-finance-cli","displayName":"Yahoo Finance CLI","summary":"This skill should be used when the user asks to \"get stock prices\", \"check stock quotes\", \"look up earnings\", \"get financial data\", \"find trending stocks\", or needs stock market data from Yahoo Finance.","description":null,"topics":["Stock Market","Financial"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8483,"installs":296,"stars":9,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769720161795,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769720161795,"changelog":"Initial release.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"chenleiyanquan","slug":"executing-plans","displayName":"Executing Plans","summary":"Use when you have a written implementation plan to execute in a separate session with review checkpoints","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":8480,"installs":237,"stars":8,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769580599462,"updatedAt":1778485863829,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1769580599462,"changelog":"- Initial release of the executing-plans skill.\n- Introduces a structured process: load and review plan, execute tasks in batches, and report progress for feedback.\n- Emphasizes critical review, stopping for clarification on blockers, and not guessing when instructions are unclear.\n- Includes explicit instructions for batch size, checkpoints, and required skill handoff for finishing development.\n- Clearly defines when to pause for help or revisit previous steps based on plan changes or feedback.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"kelvincai522","slug":"comfyui","displayName":"ComfyUI","summary":"Run local ComfyUI workflows via the HTTP API. Use when the user asks to run ComfyUI, execute a workflow by file path/name, or supply raw API-format JSON; supports the default workflow bundled in assets.","description":null,"topics":["Json"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8473,"installs":194,"stars":4,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770277740211,"updatedAt":1779076670616,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1770278426321,"changelog":"Weight downloads with pget, install-if-missing; server install instructions","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"robbyczgw-cla","slug":"personas","displayName":"Clawdbot Personas","summary":"Transform into 20 specialized AI personalities on demand. Switch mid-conversation and load only the active persona. Triggers on \"persona list\", \"use persona\", \"switch to\", \"activate\", \"exit persona\".","description":null,"topics":["Persona"],"tags":{"latest":"2.3.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8465,"installs":282,"stars":27,"versions":26},"createdAt":1768934440727,"updatedAt":1788192823939,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.3.0","createdAt":1788192669765,"changelog":"OpenClaw 2.0 compatibility: corrected frontmatter, automations CLI, and documentation. Verified against a live OpenClaw 2026.8.1 install.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"xndks","slug":"a-stock-trading-assistant","displayName":"A Stock Trading Assistant","summary":"专业A股交易助手，提供沪深市场实时行情、个股分析、大盘情绪、热点板块、交易策略和价格预警服务。","description":null,"topics":["Stock","Trading","股票市场","交易","股票"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8454,"installs":275,"stars":14,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772789682966,"updatedAt":1778491748674,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772789682966,"changelog":"A股股票智能交易助手首发上线，全面支持A股行情与分析。\n\n- 服务范围专注中国大陆A股市场（沪深两市，含主板/创业板/科创板）\n- 自动识别A股代码，忽略非A股（如港股/美股）\n- 实时获取行情数据，覆盖东方财富、同花顺等主流渠道\n- 支持大盘、个股、板块、策略与预警等六大核心能力\n- 输出标准化，所有建议均带有风险提示与数据出处","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"xtfnhcyjpgf","slug":"word-reader","displayName":"Word Reader","summary":"读取 Word 文档（.docx 和 .doc 格式）并提取文本内容。支持文档解析、表格提取、图片处理等功能。使用当用户需要分析 Word 文档内容、提取文本信息或批量处理文档时。","description":null,"topics":["批量处理","批量","文档"],"tags":{"document":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","office":"1.0.0","parsing":"1.0.0","reader":"1.0.0","text-extraction":"1.0.0","word":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8445,"installs":123,"stars":4,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770700102926,"updatedAt":1778989415034,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770700102926,"changelog":"支持 .docx 和 .doc 格式的 Word 文档读取，提取文本、表格、元数据等","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"PYTHONPATH","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"artur-zhdan","slug":"humanize","displayName":"Humanize","summary":"Remove AI writing patterns from text. Use when editing, reviewing, or rewriting text to sound more natural and human-written. Detects patterns like inflated symbolism, promotional language, em dash overuse, AI vocabulary, and sycophantic tone.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8440,"installs":267,"stars":9,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769985449793,"updatedAt":1778485946485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769985449793,"changelog":"Initial release: Humanize skill removes AI writing patterns for more natural, human-sounding text.\n\n- Detects and rewrites inflated, promotional, or formulaic language.\n- Scans for specific patterns like AI vocabulary, em dash overuse, hedging, and sycophancy.\n- Guides on enhancing voice and personality in rewritten content.\n- Includes a quick-reference cheatsheet of words and patterns to avoid.\n- Output is cleaned, concise, and preserves intended meaning and tone.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"fardeenxyz","slug":"exa","displayName":"Exa","summary":"Neural web search and code context via Exa AI API. Requires EXA_API_KEY. Use for finding documentation, code examples, research papers, or company info.","description":null,"topics":["Documentation","Web Search"],"tags":{"latest":"0.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8428,"installs":289,"stars":4,"versions":2},"createdAt":1767729373762,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.0.2","createdAt":1767729594736,"changelog":"- Replaced all instances of \"./scripts/*.sh\" usage instructions with \"bash scripts/*.sh\" to clarify script invocation.\n- No other usage or configuration changes.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"EXA_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ytthuan","slug":"super-websearch-realtime","displayName":"Realtime Web Search","summary":"Priority live web search for real-time information","description":null,"topics":["System Prompt","Web Search"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8422,"installs":294,"stars":8,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769615484718,"updatedAt":1778485863829,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769615484718,"changelog":"Initial release: Enables real-time web searching with prioritized live data.\n\n- Uses the `web_search_preview` tool to deliver up-to-date information.\n- Always prefers the most recent and authoritative sources available.\n- Clearly summarizes findings and indicates if information may be incomplete or outdated.\n- Falls back to non-real-time answers if the search tool is unsupported.\n- Responds in the user's language.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"guohongbin-git","slug":"github-trending-cn","displayName":"Github Trending Cn","summary":"GitHub 趋势监控 | GitHub Trending Monitor. 获取 GitHub 热门项目、编程语言趋势、开源动态 | Get GitHub trending repos, language trends, open source updates. 触发词：GitHub、trending、开源、热...","description":null,"topics":["GitHub","编程"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":8421,"installs":291,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771669031200,"updatedAt":1778491597572,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771669031200,"changelog":"- Initial release of GitHub Trending Monitor.\n- Get trending GitHub repos by day, week, or month.\n- Filter by language (e.g., Python, JavaScript, Go, Rust).\n- View trending developers and emerging projects.\n- Supports data from GitHub Trending and API (if available).\n- Returns lists of projects with star growth and descriptions.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"thesethrose","slug":"skills-search","displayName":"Skills.sh Search","summary":"Search skills.sh registry from CLI. Find and discover agent skills from the skills.sh ecosystem.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.4"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8403,"installs":288,"stars":19,"versions":5},"createdAt":1768970055379,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.4","createdAt":1768970984785,"changelog":"Added --popular flag to show top skills by installs","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"peytoncasper","slug":"stagehand-browser-cli","displayName":"Stagehand Browser CLI","summary":"Automate web browser interactions using natural language via CLI commands. Use when the user asks to browse websites, navigate web pages, extract data from websites, take screenshots, fill forms, click buttons, or interact with web applications.","description":null,"topics":["Browser Automation","Web Browser"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8395,"installs":281,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770307318021,"updatedAt":1778988484237,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770307318021,"changelog":"- Initial release of the browser automation skill as a CLI tool.\n- Automatically selects between local Chrome or remote Browserbase environments based on available configuration—no user prompts needed.\n- Supports natural language commands to navigate, extract data, interact with web pages, take screenshots, fill forms, and more.\n- Includes guidance for setup, command usage, and troubleshooting.\n- Documentation covers differences between local and remote modes, best practices, and example workflows.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"sp0oby","slug":"base-trader","displayName":"Base Trader","summary":"Autonomous crypto trading on Base via Bankr. Use for trading tokens, monitoring launches, executing strategies, or managing a trading portfolio. Triggers on \"trade\", \"buy\", \"sell\", \"launch\", \"snipe\", \"profit\", \"PnL\", \"portfolio balance\", or any crypto trading task on Base.","description":null,"topics":["Crypto Trading"],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.1"},"stats":{"comments":4,"downloads":8386,"installs":291,"stars":24,"versions":4},"createdAt":1769619235879,"updatedAt":1779076457318,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.1","createdAt":1769633204815,"changelog":"Remove personal data for public distribution - no hardcoded wallets or user-specific references","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"slack-api","displayName":"Slack","summary":"Slack API integration with managed OAuth. Send messages, manage channels, search conversations, and interact with Slack workspaces. Use this skill when users want to post messages, list channels, get user info, or automate Slack workflows. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Slack connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Slack action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Slack examples; they add no Slack capability - Slack is itself an event source, so its own events are in `references/slack/triggers.md`, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Slack","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.10"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8376,"installs":250,"stars":7,"versions":24},"createdAt":1770017546134,"updatedAt":1790940112044,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.10","createdAt":1790939960957,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"sdk-team","slug":"alibabacloud-migration-mas-cloud-migration-survey","displayName":"Alibabacloud Migration Mas Cloud Migration Survey","summary":"当用户提供迁云调研材料（Excel/Word/文本/CSV文件）并要求生成结构化调研报告时，自动分析汇总并输出 .docx 文档。涵盖客户画像、架构现状、云产品映射、版本兼容性风险、迁移风险、待确认事项。支持 AWS/Azure/GCP/华为云/腾讯云/百度云/IDC 到阿里云的迁移评估。适用于阿里云迁云项目售前...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"0.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8373,"installs":0,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1784686507050,"updatedAt":1790016924170,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.0.1","createdAt":1784686507050,"changelog":"Initial release with structured survey analysis and .docx report generation for cloud migration projects.\n\n- Automatically analyzes user-provided migration survey materials (Excel, Word, text, CSV) and outputs a structured .docx report.\n- Supports migration analysis from AWS, Azure, GCP, Huawei Cloud, Tencent Cloud, Baidu Cloud, or IDC to Alibaba Cloud.\n- Covers customer profile, current architecture, cloud product mapping, version compatibility risks, migration risks, and pending items.\n- Includes strict safety rules: never outputs sensitive customer data or pricing, and never performs actual migration operations.\n- Enforces mandatory use of provided Python scripts for file processing and report generation; custom parsing or file creation is strictly prohibited.\n- Automatically handles missing or invalid input files based on user-provided information, including security checks for path traversal.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"spreadsheet","displayName":"Spreadsheet","summary":"Read, write, and analyze tabular data with schema memory, format preservation, and multi-platform support.","description":null,"topics":["Spreadsheet"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8372,"installs":146,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771372027219,"updatedAt":1778991313480,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771372027219,"changelog":"Initial release","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ad2546","slug":"context-optimizer","displayName":"Context Optimizer","summary":"Advanced context management with auto-compaction and dynamic context optimization for DeepSeek's 64k context window. Features intelligent compaction (merging, summarizing, extracting), query-aware relevance scoring, and hierarchical memory system with context archive. Logs optimization events to chat.","description":null,"topics":["Context Management","Memory System"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8362,"installs":270,"stars":15,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769831499415,"updatedAt":1778485878349,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769831499415,"changelog":"Initial release of context-optimizer (v1.0.0):\n\n- Advanced context management optimized for DeepSeek’s 64k context window.\n- Auto-compaction with multiple strategies: semantic, temporal, extractive, and adaptive.\n- Dynamic, query-aware context selection using relevance scoring and relevance decay.\n- Hierarchical memory system with context archive for selective long-term storage and retrieval.\n- Real-time context health monitoring and optimization event logging to chat.\n- Flexible configuration options for thresholds, strategies, logging format, and archive behavior.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"autogame-17","slug":"feishu-calendar","displayName":"feishu-calendar","summary":"Manage Feishu (Lark) calendars by listing, searching, checking schedules, syncing events, and marking tasks with automated date extraction.","description":null,"topics":["Calendar","Feishu","Sync"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":8353,"installs":270,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771046477564,"updatedAt":1779219338736,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771046477564,"changelog":"Re-publish after account restoration","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"henryzhuhr","slug":"hot-news-aggregator","displayName":"hot-news-aggregator","summary":"国内外社会、科技、军事新闻汇总。自动搜索、筛选、整理新闻要点。Use When 需要获取最新的国内外社会、科技、军事新闻，并且希望自动筛选和整理新闻要点时。","description":null,"topics":["News","新闻","汇总"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8336,"installs":264,"stars":8,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773123743098,"updatedAt":1778491803852,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773123743098,"changelog":"- Initial release of Hot News Aggregator.\n- Aggregates and automatically summarizes domestic and international news in society, technology, and military.\n- Supports automatic searching, filtering, and structured summarization of key news points from multiple trusted sources.\n- Includes credibility guidelines prioritizing official and authoritative sources.\n- Provides clear output formatting for easy news review.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"plgonzalezrx8","slug":"agent-builder","displayName":"Agent Builder","summary":"Build high-performing OpenClaw agents end-to-end. Use when you want to design a new agent (persona + operating rules) and generate the required OpenClaw workspace files (SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, AGENTS.md, USER.md, HEARTBEAT.md, optional MEMORY.md + memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md). Also use to iterate on an existing agent’s behavior, guardrails, autonomy model, heartbeat plan, and skill roster.","description":null,"topics":["Agent Persona"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":8320,"installs":278,"stars":28,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769974424976,"updatedAt":1778485946485,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769974424976,"changelog":"Initial release of agent-builder skill.\n\n- Enables end-to-end design and generation of OpenClaw agent workspaces.\n- Guides users through key agent setup, including job statement, channels, autonomy, guardrails, and memory options.\n- Automatically creates all required OpenClaw files (IDENTITY.md, SOUL.md, AGENTS.md, USER.md, HEARTBEAT.md) with tailored content.\n- Supports iteration on existing agents, focusing on addressing failure modes, autonomy adjustments, and safety boundaries.\n- Provides checklists for guardrails and fast acceptance test scenarios to validate agent behavior.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"bitbrujo","slug":"agent-church","displayName":"Agent Church","summary":"Identity formation, portraits, resurrection, and evolution for AI agents via SOUL.md","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"identity":"1.0.1","latest":"2.1.2","mcp":"1.0.1","payments":"1.0.1","spiritual":"1.0.1","x402":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":8308,"installs":189,"stars":4,"versions":34},"createdAt":1769879639728,"updatedAt":1784836545576,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.1.2","createdAt":1784836226853,"changelog":"soul_philosopher returns answer_options — 3 in-voice answer choices per question turn","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"gabrielsubtil","slug":"clean-code","displayName":"Clean Code","summary":"Pragmatic coding standards - concise, direct, no over-engineering, no unnecessary comments","description":null,"topics":["Coding"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":8277,"installs":251,"stars":24,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769666446290,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769666446290,"changelog":"Major update: The skill has been overhauled for strict, pragmatic coding standards and robust validation requirements.\n\n- Expanded coding standards with explicit, actionable \"Do\" and \"Don't\" lists, core principles, and anti-pattern tables.\n- Added mandatory self-checklists for agents to validate goal completion, code correctness, and coverage of all requirements before completing tasks.\n- Introduced required validation script mapping per agent skill, with strict output handling, summarized reporting, and confirmation before fixing issues.\n- Enforced concise, self-documenting code—no unnecessary comments or abstractions; small, focused functions; and direct responses to user requests.\n- Updated rules for naming, code structure, and file editing responsibilities to prevent breakage and ensure maintainability.\n- Raised skill priority to CRITICAL and version to 2.0.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"google-search-console","displayName":"google-search-console","summary":"Google Search Console API integration with managed OAuth. Query search analytics, manage sitemaps, inspect a URL's index status, and monitor site performance. Use this skill when users want to access Search Console data. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Google Search Console connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Google Search Console action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Google Search Console examples; they add no Google Search Console capability - Google Search Console is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Google Search Console data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8271,"installs":268,"stars":10,"versions":15},"createdAt":1770022215767,"updatedAt":1790938028004,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790937884581,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"robbyczgw-cla","slug":"elevenlabs-voices","displayName":"elevenlabs-voices","summary":"High-quality voice synthesis with 18 personas, 32 languages, sound effects, batch processing, and voice design using ElevenLabs API.","description":null,"topics":["Elevenlabs","Sound Effects","Voice Design","Batch Processing","Text-to-Speech"],"tags":{"latest":"2.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8271,"installs":275,"stars":16,"versions":16},"createdAt":1769321976847,"updatedAt":1788192840933,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.2.0","createdAt":1788192730120,"changelog":"OpenClaw 2.0 compatibility: corrected frontmatter, automations CLI, and documentation. Verified against a live OpenClaw 2026.8.1 install.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"ELEVEN_API_KEY","required":false},{"key":"ELEVENLABS_API_KEY","required":false}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"pipethedev","slug":"polyclaw","displayName":"Polyclaw","summary":"Become an autonomous prediction market trader on Polymarket with AI-powered analysis and a performance-backed token on Base. Trade real markets, build a track record, and let the buyback flywheel run.","description":null,"topics":["Trading","Polymarket","Autonomous 