cluding a1, webId, x-s, x-s-common, x-t, sec_poison_id, websectiga, gid, x-b3-traceid, x-xray-traceid. Supports guest mode and authenticated sessions via web_session cookie.","description":null,"topics":["Home","小红书"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8163,"installs":243,"stars":13,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770095284943,"updatedAt":1779076578928,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770095284943,"changelog":"Initial release of the XiaoHongShu (Little Red Book) data collection and interaction toolkit.\n\n- Search and scrape notes/posts by keyword\n- Fetch user profiles, note details, comments, likes, and trending content\n- Support for following users and liking posts\n- Handles all required XiaoHongShu encryption parameters (no browser/JS required)\n- Allows operation in both guest mode and authenticated mode (via web_session cookie)\n- Proxy support for bypassing platform restrictions and rate limits\n- Provides detailed usage instructions, example workflows, and troubleshooting tips","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"mvanhorn","slug":"search-x","displayName":"Search X","summary":"Real-time X/Twitter search powered by Grok-4. Find tweets, trends, and discussions with citations. Grok-4.20 also returns image results alongside tweet citat...","description":null,"topics":["Tweet","Twitter"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8162,"installs":276,"stars":32,"versions":8},"createdAt":1769196247403,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.1","createdAt":1772859034676,"changelog":"Fix display name (remove Clawdbot prefix)","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"XAI_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"cellcog","slug":"deep-research-cellcog","displayName":"Deep Research","summary":"AI deep research powered by CellCog. Market research, competitive analysis, investment research, academic research, due diligence, literature reviews with citations,