nnection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Constant Contact action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Constant Contact examples; they add no Constant Contact capability - Constant Contact is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Constant Contact data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Marketing","Api Integration","Email"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":8112,"installs":213,"stars":3,"versions":15},"createdAt":1770462945784,"updatedAt":1790936882891,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790936768281,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"pors","slug":"openai-tts","displayName":"OpenAI TTS","summary":"Text-to-speech via OpenAI Audio Speech API.","description":null,"topics":["Text-to-Speech","Audio"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":8094,"installs":278,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767688174911,"updatedAt":1778485729679,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767688174911,"changelog":"Initial release - text-to-speech via OpenAI API with 6 voice options","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"OPENAI_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"mnetfairy","slug":"ai-era-career-planner","displayName":"ai-era-career-planner","summary":"AI时代职业规划师技能。专为AI时代职场变化而设计，帮助用户应对AI带来的职业冲击与机遇。当用户询问职业规划、职业建议、选专业、职场转型、未来就业方向时触