order","displayName":"Food Order","summary":"Reorder Foodora orders + track ETA/status with ordercli. Never confirm without explicit user approval. Triggers: order food, reorder, track ETA.","description":null,"topics":["Food"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7693,"installs":409,"stars":9,"versions":1},"createdAt":1767545315134,"updatedAt":1779135043100,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545315134,"changelog":"","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"summarizer","displayName":"Summarizer","summary":"Summarizes any source without losing the claim: documents, meetings, papers, threads, transcripts, data, and code changes. Use when asked to summarize, condense, shorten, recap, distill, or write a TLDR, abstract, or executive summary; when a source is too long to read or must hit a word count; when summarizing a call, interview, Slack channel, pull request, contract, earnings report, podcast, or a stack of sources on one topic; when a summary dropped something important, invented a detail, turned a hedge into a fact, or reads like the headings; and when the same material must be re-cut for another audience, length, or channel. Covers compression ratios, chunking, faithfulness and omission audits. Not for recurring external feeds (`digest`), decision documents whose point is the recommendation (`brief`), cross-source insight generation rather than compression (`synthesize`), or pulling text or a transcript out of a file or video first (`extract-pdf-text`, `youtube-video-transcript`).","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7688,"installs":240,"stars":5,"versions":3},"createdAt":1770905246695,"updatedAt":1785146513103,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1785141173932,"changelog":"Clearer disclosure of what is stored and where","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"harshhmaniya","slug":"x-post-automation","displayName":"X(Twitter) Post Automation","summary":"Automates the process of identifying trends on X (Twitter), generating opinionated/engaging content, and posting it. Use when asked to post to X, run X automation, or check trends for content creation.","description":null,"topics":["Content Creation","Twitter"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7678,"installs":240,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770275052392,"updatedAt":1779076251590,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770275052392,"changelog":"Initial release of x-automation skill.\n\n- Automates trend identification on X (Twitter) and content generation based on trending topics.\n- Analyzes top tweets per trend and generates bold, opinionated candidate posts.\n- Posts selected content to X and notifies the user of success or failure.\n- Logs candidate tweets and errors for review and troubleshooting.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"gitgoodordietrying","slug":"csv-pipeline","displayName":"CSV Data Pipeline","summary":"Process, transform, analyze, and report on CSV and JSON data files. Use when the user needs to filter rows, join datasets, compute aggregates, convert formats, deduplicate, or generate summary reports from tabular data. Works with any CSV, TSV, or JSON Lines file.","description":null,"topics":["CSV","Data Pipeline","Json"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7674,"installs":236,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770151669885,"updatedAt":1778486013286,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770151669885,"changelog":"Initial release - CSV/JSON/TSV data processing with filtering, joining, grouping, aggregation, format conversion, deduplication, validation, and report generation using Python and standard CLI tools.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"shashwatgtm","slug":"competitive-intelligence-market-research","displayName":"Competitive Intelligence & Market Research","summary":"B2B SaaS competitive intelligence with 24 scenarios across Sales/HR/Fintech/Ops Tech","description":null,"topics":["Competitive Intelligence","Market Research","Sales"],"tags":{"b2b":"1.0.0","competitive-analysis":"1.0.0","gtm":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","market-research":"1.0.0","saas":"1.0.0","sales-enablement":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7671,"installs":245,"stars":13,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769418026006,"updatedAt":1778485852489,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769418026006,"changelog":"Initial release: B2B SaaS competitive intelligence skill with multi-dimensional guidance.\n\n- Supports 24 research scenarios across Sales, HR, Fintech, and Operations Tech sectors.\n- Covers different company stages (Series A–D+) and geographies (India, US, Global).\n- Step-by-step navigator helps users identify best practices for their vertical, stage, market, and team role.\n- Includes quick-start scenarios for common use cases (e.g., founder battle cards, PMM analysis, CMO market mapping).\n- Provides in-depth sample walkthrough for Sales Tech at Series A: competitor mapping, pricing research, positioning, and battle card synthesis.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"wscats","slug":"xhs-cn","displayName":"小红书","summary":"小红书自动化运营工具-支持：搜索笔记、查看笔记详情及评论、浏览推荐流、发布图文笔记。 当用户提及 xiaohongshu、小红书、RedNote，或需要在该平台进行内容调研/发布时使用。","description":null,"topics":["小红书","笔记","调研"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.10"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7663,"installs":240,"stars":15,"versions":10},"createdAt":1773935426119,"updatedAt":1778492038538,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.10","createdAt":1777705863669,"changelog":"Version 1.0.10\n\n- 增强客户端安全措施：新增自动检测，默认拒绝所有不安全或未授权的 `publish` 操作。\n- SKILL.md 文档重写，明确所有客户端内置护栏，以及上游组件独立、非本仓库维护的提醒。\n- 快速参考与市场调研、内容发布流程重构，突出强制逐步授权和机械性安全检查细节。\n- 简化注意事项，删除/合并部分重复的人工安全警告，统一以客户端强制规约为准。","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"lancelin111","slug":"crawl4ai-skill","displayName":"Crawl4ai Skill","summary":"Web crawling and scraping tool with LLM-optimized output. 网页爬虫爬取工具 | Web crawler, web scraper, spider. DuckDuckGo search, site crawling, dynamic page scrapin...","description":null,"topics":["Crawler","Duckduckgo","Scraper","Spider","Web Crawling"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.10"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":7648,"installs":155,"stars":4,"versions":11},"createdAt":1773146066723,"updatedAt":1778491807445,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.10","createdAt":1773206160408,"changelog":"**Crawl4AI Skill 1.1.0 — Bilingual, Expanded Doc, and Dynamic Scraping**\n\n- Major rewrite of documentation for improved clarity; now fully bilingual (English & Chinese).\n- Expanded feature list to highlight DuckDuckGo search, full-site crawling, dynamic page (JavaScript) scraping, and LLM-optimized outputs.\n- Added command examples and use cases for both static and dynamic web pages.\n- More tags introduced for better discoverability (e.g., spider, crawler, 爬虫).\n- Added comparison and value proposition section: free, no API key, smart extraction, dynamic content support.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"cellcog","slug":"excel-spreadsheet-cellcog","displayName":"Excel Spreadsheet","summary":"AI Excel spreadsheet generation powered by CellCog. Financial models, budget templates, data trackers, projections, pivot tables, complex formulas — XLSX output. Data manipulation, analysis, charts, and professional formatting.","description":null,"topics":["Spreadsheets","Spreadsheet","Financial"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.18"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7637,"installs":184,"stars":6,"versions":19},"createdAt":1770176443809,"updatedAt":1787537048066,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.18","createdAt":1787537004908,"changelog":"Content updated.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"CELLCOG_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":["darwin","linux","windows"]