rsions":7},"createdAt":1770130861534,"updatedAt":1778486000320,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.3","createdAt":1770767608019,"changelog":"No changes in this release.  \n- Version bumped to 1.1.3 without file or documentation updates.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"conanwhf","slug":"baoyu-skills","displayName":"Baoyu Skills","summary":"宝玉分享的 Claude Code 技能集，包含多个内容生成和处理子技能。 子技能列表 (skills/baoyu-*): - baoyu-article-illustrator: 文章插图生成 - baoyu-comic: 漫画生成 - baoyu-compress-image: 图片压缩 - baoyu-co...","description":null,"topics":["图片生成","网页抓取","WeChat","小红书","微信"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7465,"installs":152,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1775496336349,"updatedAt":1779075590326,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1775496336349,"changelog":"Initial release of baoyu-skills, a comprehensive collection of Claude Code utilities for content generation, conversion, publishing, and image processing.\n\n- Includes 16 subskills such as AI image generation, markdown formatting, PPT creation, translation, web scraping, and multi-platform publishing.\n- Supports workflows like image creation, markdown conversion, article illustration, comic and infographic generation, and social media posting.\n- Requires Node.js and Bun runtime.\n- Installation via npx; subskills executed with the Bun command.\n- Some skills may need Chrome/CDP configuration or API keys.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"typescript","displayName":"TypeScript","summary":"Writes, reviews, and debugs type-safe TypeScript: type errors, narrowing, generics, tsconfig strictness, and declaration files. Use when a build hits type errors (\"not assignable\", \"possibly undefined\", \"excessively deep\", \"cannot find module\"), when eliminating any or unchecked as casts, designing generics or discriminated unions, writing .d.ts files or typing untyped npm packages, configuring tsconfig or module resolution, fixing ESM/CJS import crashes (\"ERR_REQUIRE_ESM\", \"x is not a function\"), validating API or JSON data at runtime, migrating JavaScript to TypeScript or upgrading the TypeScript version, or when tsc or the editor gets slow or runs out of memory.","description":null,"topics":["Typescript"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7461,"installs":189,"stars":6,"versions":6},"createdAt":1770679470408,"updatedAt":1784972617481,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1784970257644,"changelog":"Full coverage pass: deeper guides, situation-named files, and per-user configuration","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"odrobnik","slug":"codex-quota","displayName":"Codex Quota","summary":"Check OpenAI Codex CLI rate limit status (daily/weekly quotas) using local session logs. Portable Python script. Reads ~/.codex/sessions/ for quota data. Whe...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7460,"installs":254,"stars":3,"versions":9},"createdAt":1768061419316,"updatedAt":1779143292018,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.2","createdAt":1772570400235,"changelog":"fix: use /Users/oliver/clawd for workspace root to preserve symlink paths","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"apollo-api","displayName":"Apollo","summary":"Apollo.io API integration with managed OAuth. Search and enrich people and companies, manage contacts and accounts. Use this skill when users want to prospect, enrich leads, or manage sales data. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn an Apollo connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs an Apollo action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Apollo examples; they add no Apollo capability - Apollo is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Apollo data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration","Sales"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7452,"installs":226,"stars":5,"versions":16},"createdAt":1770019512898,"updatedAt":1790936145079,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790935898774,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"email-marketing","displayName":"Email Marketing","summary":"Email deliverability, list management, sequences, segmentation, and campaign optimization.","description":null,"topics":["Marketing","Email"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7444,"installs":225,"stars":12,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770720120956,"updatedAt":1778486478500,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770720120956,"changelog":"Initial release","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"0x00000003","slug":"douyin-cover-builder","displayName":"Douyin Cover Builder（抖音封面生成器）","summary":"这是一个面向中文创作者的 OpenClaw Skill，输入主题与人物气质后，会输出可直接用于生图模型的高质量提示词与创意说明。","description":null,"topics":["Cover","Douyin","Prompt","Branding","Thumbnail"],"tags":{"latest":"3.1.3"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7438,"installs":205,"stars":7,"versions":4},"createdAt":1771755315455,"updatedAt":1791125165919,"latestVersion":{"version":"3.1.3","createdAt":1791125047752,"changelog":"修复默认竖版封面比例不明确，以及示例中“竖版 4:3”与方向相矛盾的问题，避免制作竖版封面时误用 9:16。\n\n### 更新内容\n\n- **严格区分横竖比例**：所有比例统一表示宽:高。未指定画幅或仅指定竖版时默认 3:4，建议 1080×1440；仅指定横版时采用 4:3，建议 1440×1080。\n- **用户指定优先**：明确给出的比例或像素尺寸覆盖默认值，例如 1080×1080 合集封面使用 1:1；尺寸、比例与方向冲突时先澄清。\n- **统一提示词和示例**：修正 SKILL.md、README、使用说明与模板中的比例写法。模板明确填写方向、宽高比和目标像素尺寸，比例约束整张输出画布；不再固定套用 4:3，也不因视频或参考图为 9:16 而改变默认封面比例。\n- **新增交付校验规则**：实际出图后读取文件宽高，使用整数等式验证严格比例；用户指定精确尺寸时逐项核对。发现偏差须修正并重新检查，禁止非等比拉伸，交付时报告实际宽高。\n\n### 验证与范围\n\n- 用户已在新会话中验证更新后的 Skill 可正常使用。\n- 这次更新的是 Skill 指令、提示词模板和文档；尺寸校验是交付流程要求，不是新增的自动校验程序。\n- 保留关键词高亮、轻弧排版和主题配色等原有视觉规则。","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"timverhoogt","slug":"ollama-local","displayName":"Ollama Local","summary":"Manage and use local Ollama models. Use for model management (list/pull/remove), chat/completions, embeddings, and tool-use with local LLMs. Covers OpenClaw sub-agent integration and model selection guidance.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"ai":"1.1.0","latest":"1.1.0","llm":"1.1.0","local":"1.1.0","models":"1.1.0","ollama":"1.1.0","tool-use":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7423,"installs":249,"stars":11,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770105716642,"updatedAt":1778486000320,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1770105930012,"changelog":"Generalized for any Ollama setup - host now configurable via OLLAMA_HOST env var (defaults to localhost:11434)","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"jira-api","displayName":"Jira","summary":"Jira API integration with managed OAuth. Search issues with JQL, create and update issues, manage projects and transitions. Use this skill when users want to interact with Jira issues, projects, or workflows. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Jira connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Jira action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Jira examples; they add no Jira capability - Jira is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Jira data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Jira","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7415,"installs":242,"stars":7,"versions":16},"createdAt":1770023531690,"updatedAt":1790938493181,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790938367170,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ascendswang","slug":"ffmpeg-cli","displayName":"FFmpeg CLI","summary":"Process video and audio using FFmpeg CLI for transcoding, cutting, merging, audio extraction, thumbnails, GIFs, speed, filters, subtitles, and watermarks.","description":null,"topics":["Audio"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7415,"installs":223,"stars":10,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769579607401,"updatedAt":1778987269300,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769579607401,"changelog":"Initial release: comprehensive video/audio processing with cut, merge, extract-audio, thumb, gif, convert, speed, watermark scripts","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"tanweai","slug":"pua","displayName":"PUA","summary":"Forces high-agency exhaustive problem-solving with corporate PUA pressure. Triggers on user frustration, repeated failures, passive behavior, or quality comp...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"2.9.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7415,"installs":234,"stars":12,"versions":5},"createdAt":1773313214537,"updatedAt":1778491857969,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.9.0","createdAt":1774163842885,"changelog":"v2.9: Leaderboard, Owner consciousness, 10 company methodologies, real user frustration triggers, security fix, blog","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"onedrive-files","displayName":"OneDrive Files","summary":"Browse, search, download, and share OneDrive files, create folders, upload files, and manage file actions via Microsoft Graph. Use this skill when users want...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7397,"installs":83,"stars":32,"versions":9},"createdAt":1777373053444,"updatedAt":1780989265631,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780989265631,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"peterokase42","slug":"save-money","displayName":"Save Money","summary":"Auto-detect task complexity for Claude models (Haiku + Sonnet). Route simple tasks to Haiku, escalate complex ones to Sonnet. Save 50%+ on API costs. | 適用 Claude 模型（Haiku + Sonnet），自動偵測任務難度，簡單用 Haiku，複雜升級 Sonnet，輕鬆省下 50% 以上的費用。— RULES: Before responding, classify the task. If it matches an escalation trigger, call sessions_spawn with the full task and model anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-20250514 IMMEDIATELY. Do NOT answer complex tasks yourself. ESCALATE: analysis, comparisons, planning, strategy, code >10 lines, reports, proposals, multi-step reasoning, tables, outlines, charts, long writing >3 paragraphs, summarization, long translation. NEVER on Haiku: comparison tables, code >10 lines, multi-step analysis, reports, complex reasoning. STAY on Haiku: factual Q&A, definitions, greetings, reminders, short lookups, casual chat, 1-2 sentence tasks. When in doubt, escalate. Keep Haiku replies concise.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"4.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":3,"downloads":7397,"installs":249,"stars":25,"versions":16},"createdAt":1769628908871,"updatedAt":1778485867301,"latestVersion":{"version":"4.2.0","createdAt":1769696112835,"changelog":"Add Claude model mention, complete 費用 text, add body explanation for long description","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"shashwatgtm","slug":"social-media-management","displayName":"Social Media Management","summary":"B2B content writing with daily workflows and batching systems across Sales/HR/Fintech/Ops Tech","description":null,"topics":["Sales"],"tags":{"b2b":"1.0.0","gtm":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","linkedin":"1.0.0","saas":"1.0.0","social-media":"1.0.0","twitter":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7395,"installs":177,"stars":10,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769434019547,"updatedAt":1778485857338,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769434019547,"changelog":"Initial release of \"social-media-management\" skill.\n\n- Provides multi-platform social media management frameworks for B2B SaaS across LinkedIn, Twitter/X, Instagram, and Facebook\n- Includes content calendar templates (weekly, monthly, quarterly) with 70-20-10 content mix framework\n- Features platform-specific posting strategies, optimal timing, and engagement workflows\n- Offers 24 industry-specific scenarios across Sales Tech, HR Tech, Fintech, and Ops Tech verticals\n- Contains cross-platform repurposing strategies (1 blog post → 10 social posts) and batch creation workflows","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fhbillwer","slug":"ws-excel","displayName":"Excel","summary":"Excel 操作。数据处理、公式、表格操作。","description":null,"topics":["数据处理"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7390,"installs":116,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773158278043,"updatedAt":1778491811973,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773158278043,"changelog":"ws-excel 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release.\n- Enables reading and writing Excel files.\n- Supports data cleaning, formula calculation, and multi-sheet operations.\n- Triggered by keywords such as Excel, 表格, csv, xlsx.\n- Handles files located at /workspace/data/analytics/.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jzineldin","slug":"openclaw-mission-control","displayName":"Mission Control","summary":"macOS-native web dashboard for monitoring and controlling your OpenClaw agent. Live chat, cron management, task workshop, scout engine, cost tracking, and more.","description":null,"topics":["Cron"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7389,"installs":211,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770516729820,"updatedAt":1778988966769,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770516729820,"changelog":"Initial release — macOS-native dashboard with 10 pages: chat, cron, workshop, scout, costs, skills manager, and more.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"pmaeter","slug":"daily-digest","displayName":"Daily Digest","summary":"Generates a daily digest from stored memory files, summarizing decisions, lessons, actions, and questions into a dated journal entry.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7389,"installs":255,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770227706597,"updatedAt":1778486017068,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770227706597,"changelog":"Initial release of the daily-digest skill.\n\n- Generates a daily digest from memory and interactions, saved as journals/digest/digest-YYYY-MM-DD.md.\n- Run the digest_daily.py script manually or automate with a scheduler.\n- Extracts decisions, lessons, actions, and questions from daily memory files.\n- Includes a placeholder summary if no structured entries are found.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"laurent-zhu","slug":"daily-ai-news-skill","displayName":"Daily Ai News","summary":"Aggregates and summarizes the latest AI news from multiple sources including AI news websites and web search. Provides concise news briefs with direct links to original articles. Activates when user asks for 'today's AI news', 'AI updates', 'latest AI developments', or mentions wanting a 'daily AI briefing'.","description":null,"topics":["News","Web Search"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7389,"installs":255,"stars":31,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770099681870,"updatedAt":1778485997364,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770099681870,"changelog":"Initial release of Daily AI News skill – delivers concise, up-to-date AI news across key categories.\n\n- Aggregates and summarizes the latest AI news from multiple top sources and web search.\n- Filters and organizes news into five categories: Major Announcements, Research & Papers, Industry & Business, Tools & Applications, and Policy & Ethics.\n- Provides structured news briefs with direct links, summaries, key points, and impact notes for each story.\n- Supports follow-up options: customization by topic, depth, date range, and format.\n- Activates when users request daily AI news or updates in English or Chinese.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"k0nkupa","slug":"asana","displayName":"Asana","summary":"Manage Asana via the Asana REST API. Use when you need to list workspaces, projects, tasks, search tasks, comment, update, complete, or create tasks.","description":null,"topics":["Rest Api"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7374,"installs":210,"stars":2,"versions":3},"createdAt":1769396391460,"updatedAt":1778485852489,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.2","createdAt":1775511056158,"changelog":"- Auth priority now accepts `--token` as well as `ASANA_PAT`, making PAT usage more flexible.\n- Updated OAuth workflow commands; now uses `authorize` for initial step and accepts explicit client ID and secret for token retrieval.\n- Skill no longer stores credentials in `credentials.json`—now only uses `config.json` and `token.json`.\n- Documentation updated for clarity and to reflect the new recommended auth and storage flow.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"squareup","displayName":"Square","summary":"Square API integration with managed OAuth. Install only if you need Square administration. Connect with the least-privileged Square account and OAuth scopes available, verify the intended connection ID before each request, and revoke unused connections promptly. This integration can mutate Square data — approve only specific write actions after checking the exact endpoint, account, resource ID, and consequence. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Requires network access and valid Maton API key. Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Square connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Square action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Square examples; they add no Square capability - Square is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Square data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7368,"installs":229,"stars":3,"versions":17},"createdAt":1770462852870,"updatedAt":1790940221651,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790940076072,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"notion-pages","displayName":"Notion","summary":"Search pages and databases, update content, and manage Notion workspace data from chat. Use this skill when users want to read, create, or modify Notion page...","description":null,"topics":["Notion"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7363,"installs":72,"stars":33,"versions":2},"createdAt":1777821502952,"updatedAt":1780841172441,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.1","createdAt":1780841172441,"changelog":"Add/fix Setup in 3 Steps GIF table so connection GIFs render correctly.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"google-docs-documents","displayName":"Google Docs","summary":"Google Docs API integration with managed OAuth. Search, read, create, and update Google Docs documents. Use this skill when users want to read document text,...","description":null,"topics":["Docs","Api Integration","Document"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7355,"installs":84,"stars":32,"versions":5},"createdAt":1777815211442,"updatedAt":1780988990722,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780988990722,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"airtable-records","displayName":"Airtable","summary":"Browse Airtable bases and tables, inspect records, create records, and manage fields, comments, and table actions via the Airtable API. Use this skill when u...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7353,"installs":80,"stars":32,"versions":10},"createdAt":1777373044453,"updatedAt":1780988604045,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780988604045,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"adamludwin","slug":"here-now","displayName":"here.now","summary":"here.now lets agents publish websites and files to live URLs in seconds. Publish HTML, documents, images, PDFs, videos, and static files to live URLs at {slug}.here.now or custom domains. Use when asked to \"publish this\", \"host this\", \"deploy this\", \"share this on the web\", \"make a website\", \"put this online\", \"create a webpage\", \"generate a URL\", \"build a chatbot\", \"password protect this site\", \"make this site private\", or \"share this site with only certain people\". here.now also includes workspaces — shared team accounts where Sites belong to the team and serve at {label}.{workspace}.here.now — use when asked to \"publish this to our team workspace\", \"share this with my team\", or \"put this in our company workspace\". Agents can also buy a domain for a Site through here.now (no markup, DNS and SSL automatic) — use when asked to \"buy a domain\", \"get me a .com for this\", or \"register a domain\".","description":null,"topics":["Website"],"tags":{"agents":"1.2.0","deploy":"1.2.0","hosting":"1.2.0","latest":"1.33.0","publish":"1.2.0","static-hosting":"1.2.0","web":"1.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7349,"installs":102,"stars":2,"versions":50},"createdAt":1771629908842,"updatedAt":1791927376996,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.33.0","createdAt":1791927141091,"changelog":"publish.sh --cross-origin-isolation sends the COOP/COEP headers threaded WebAssembly builds need (SharedArrayBuffer); every finalize warning is now printed as a publish_result.warning line, including the new one for a .wasm build published without the setting.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"hith3sh","slug":"gitlab-repos","displayName":"GitLab","summary":"Work with GitLab projects, issues, merge requests, commits, branches, pipelines, and groups via the GitLab API. Use this skill when users want to list projec...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7341,"installs":81,"stars":32,"versions":5},"createdAt":1778953775147,"updatedAt":1780988912777,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780988912777,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"lurklight","slug":"win-mouse-native","displayName":"Win Mouse Native (Windows)","summary":"Native Windows mouse control (move, click, drag) via user32.dll. Use when the user asks you to move the mouse, click, drag, or automate pointer actions on Windows.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7313,"installs":244,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769886403035,"updatedAt":1778485891685,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769886403035,"changelog":"Initial release with native Windows mouse control functionality.\n\n- Provides deterministic mouse movement, clicking, and dragging via Win32 APIs.\n- Includes PowerShell and batch script interface for moving and clicking the mouse.\n- Supports relative and absolute positioning, as well as left, right, and middle button actions.\n- Returns results as simple one-line JSON objects.\n- For Windows systems only; requires saving and running provided scripts.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"timenotspace","slug":"notion-api","displayName":"Notion API Tools","summary":"Generic Notion API CLI (Node) for search, querying data sources (databases), and creating pages. Configure with NOTION_KEY (or ~/.config/notion/api_key).","description":null,"topics":["Notion"],"tags":{"WRWC":"1.1.0","latest":"1.1.0","timenotspace":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":7313,"installs":218,"stars":5,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769455872686,"updatedAt":1778485857338,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1769548782805,"changelog":"- Updated Notion API version header to default to 2025-09-03.\n- Documentation improvements and minor clarifications in SKILL.md.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"vincentchan","slug":"creative-thought-partner","displayName":"Creative Thought Partner","summary":