h","displayName":"Flight Search","summary":"Search Google Flights for prices, times, and airlines. No API key required.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.7"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7284,"installs":242,"stars":6,"versions":5},"createdAt":1770357958578,"updatedAt":1778486040582,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.7","createdAt":1770362463005,"changelog":"Release 0.1.7","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"xiongjjlj","slug":"feishu-docx-powerwrite","displayName":"Feishu Docx PowerWrite","summary":"High-quality Feishu/Lark Docx writing via OpenClaw. Use when you want to turn Markdown into well-formatted Feishu Docx (headings, lists, nesting, code blocks) using feishu_docx_write_markdown; includes safe workflows, templates, and troubleshooting. Trigger on Feishu doc/docx links, “write to Feishu doc”, “generate a Feishu doc”, “append/replace docx”, “convert markdown to feishu doc”, or when users want consistently good doc formatting.","description":null,"topics":["Feishu"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7270,"installs":249,"stars":10,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770197180818,"updatedAt":1778486017068,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770197180818,"changelog":"Initial release: Docx markdown writing workflow + templates + troubleshooting","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"vibe-coding","displayName":"Vibe Coding","summary":"Build software with AI by describing what you want. Covers prompting techniques, workflow patterns, rules files, and when to intervene.","description":null,"topics":["Coding"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7268,"installs":221,"stars":7,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771264018419,"updatedAt":1778491556797,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771264018419,"changelog":"Initial release","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"acuity-scheduling","displayName":"acuity-scheduling","summary":"Acuity Scheduling API integration with managed OAuth. Manage appointments, calendars, clients, and availability. Use this skill when users want to schedule, reschedule, or cancel appointments, check availability, or manage clients and calendars. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which Acuity enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other Acuity endpoint needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn an Acuity Scheduling connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs an Acuity Scheduling action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Acuity Scheduling examples; they add no Acuity Scheduling capability - Acuity Scheduling is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Acuity Scheduling data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7265,"installs":227,"stars":3,"versions":13},"createdAt":1770420088246,"updatedAt":1790935959928,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790935787546,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"tunaissacoding","slug":"claude-connect","displayName":"Claude Connect","summary":"Connect Claude to Clawdbot instantly and keep it connected 24/7. Run after setup to link your subscription, then auto-refreshes tokens forever.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7264,"installs":240,"stars":13,"versions":12},"createdAt":1769191676464,"updatedAt":1779076399308,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1769399254595,"changelog":"Fixed OAuth auth-profiles.json format bug","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"johanesalxd","slug":"vision-sandbox","displayName":"Vision Sandbox","summary":"Agentic Vision via Gemini's native Code Execution sandbox. Use for spatial grounding, visual math, and UI auditing.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7264,"installs":253,"stars":1,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769907739358,"updatedAt":1778485932126,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1769934576198,"changelog":"Migrate to standard OpenClaw tool configuration","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"GEMINI_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"dragon015","slug":"dragon-ppt-maker","displayName":"PPT制作","summary":"使用python-pptx制作科技风PPT，支持多布局、多图文混排及HTML内容嵌入，轻松生成专业演示文稿。","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":7262,"installs":235,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772352557960,"updatedAt":1778994175694,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772352557960,"changelog":"初始版本","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"tongyu-yan","slug":"turix-cua","displayName":"TuriX Computer Use","summary":"Computer Use Agent (CUA) 